# MACRO parameter key definition can overlap with ALU jump condition
# MACRO parameter key reference can conflict with ALU jump condition: ALU jump condition takes precedence
# - ALU jump operation can only be UPPER CASE
# - MACRO parameter key reference can conflict with ALU jump condition only when UPPER CASE

%MACRO macro.JNE JNE
A = JNE
%END

macro.JNE 12345
